    "CYM-bounty-filing-unauthenticated": {
      "id": "CYM-bounty-filing-unauthenticated",
      "title": "Filing a bug report passes authorization with no credential: hunter attribution rests on an unauthenticated form field",
      "severity": "S1-INTEGRITY",
      "tag": "PROCESS",
      "kind": "authorization",
      "section": "support",
      "component": "rest.support",
      "note": "POST /api/v1/bounty/reports with an empty body returns a byte-identical validation error with no key and with a TRUSTED key. No authorization check runs before validation. If that holds for a populated body, hunter_name is a field any caller sets freely and reward attribution is unauthenticated. SCOPE: an empty body shows only that auth does not run FIRST. It does not show a fully-populated anonymous POST is accepted -- testing that would create a real record in their tracker, so it is asked, not done. Verified after probing that the tracker total was unchanged at 23.",
